anager id; shutdown closes all leases/sockets/child groups. Отдельные socket endpoints не маскировать как singleton connection.\",\n        \"verification_ids\": [\n          \"VER-005\"\n        ],\n        \"evidence_level\": \"design contract; implementation oracle pending Stage3/L2\"\n      },\n      \"C-MULT-I4\": {\n        \"status\": \"PASS\",\n        \"substitution\": \"Любой timeout/cancel на slot/gate/ready/prompt/read/write вызывает общий finally; cleanup idempotent; counters waiters/in_use/children/sockets возвращаются0; disconnect не запускает retry.\",\n        \"oracle\": \"50 controlled cancel cycles в каждой фазе через Events, cancel-before/after lease acquisition, counters==0; не считать daemon=True механизмом cleanup.\",\n        \"verification_ids\": [\n          \"VER-005\"\n        ],\n        \"evidence_level\": \"design contract; implementation oracle pending Stage3/L2\"\n      },\n      \"C-MULT-I5\": {\n        \"status\": \"PASS\",\n        \"substitution\": \"ParentFD steady108 +6 transient lifeline_r=114<=envelope128<=0.70*65536=45875.2. System128+6serve20+6helper8+6probe8=344descriptors; probe=lsof/ps at most1/slot nonoverlap. Parent55admitted threads,peak19processes. lifeline_w always finally closes; helper and serve share child_pgid=helper_proc.pid.3HTTP lanes/serve; nodeports3.6*60+30=246<=8192,SNAT1.8*60+12=120<=8192,0probe network. RSS serve156.8+helper~12+probe~8=176.8MiB under192/slot,full1408<=1638.4; all estimates until H3.\",\n        \"oracle\": \"Entire normal Keep-Alive path(permission/form/reply/interrupt/DELETE),including50controls:exactly1 lsof/successful spawn and1retained control TCP. Separate explicit control-socket reconnect scenario permits only2nd lsof<=0.35s outside reply0.25s/cleanupAPI0.20s; spies distinguish the scenarios; urgent control disconnect is fail-closed,never lsof wait.3forced lsof timeouts ->3ServeHealth failures->DEGRADED,nextauto has0serve/helper/lsof Popen. Check listener_pid==serve_pid and pgid