кует serve_pid/serve_lstart до handshake/READY. --serve-helper <attempt_id> находится в первых аргументах ps -ww argv. До отправки любых Authorization/пароля или prompt обязательны одновременно listener_pid == serve_pid, os.getpgid(listener_pid) == child_pgid и helper_proc.poll() is None; ровно один lsof с бюджетом <=0.35s внутри общего ready<=3.0s. На mismatch/timeout/неоднозначность 0 байт Authorization/пароля/prompt, fail-closed, retry только внутри исходного ready/cap3 после cleanup. Cleanup os.killpg(child_pgid, SIGTERM→SIGKILL) охватывает подтверждённые собственные helper + serve + потомков, с lifeline/reap/root+lease cleanup по crash_recovery; чужой PID в той же или иной группе получает 0 байт пароля и 0 сигналов чужому PGID. Секреты только sanitized env, без argv/lease/log; no redirects/proxy. Normal Keep-Alive control path не вызывает повторный lsof; отдельный explicit reconnect имеет собственный proof, как listener_ownership.\",\n+      \"packet_locations\": [\n+        \"/threat_model/threats/0\",\n+        \"/decisions/0/details/spawn\",\n+        \"/decisions/0/details/listener_ownership\",\n+        \"/decisions/0/details/cleanup\",\n+        \"/verification_surface/4/process_resource_oracle/listener_takeover_negative\"\n+      ],\n+      \"verification\": \"EVD-075..078 observed local probes plus JSON Pointer/schema/fingerprint checks; actual Stage3 VER-001..005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a5/r9 review pending.\",\n+      \"decision_required_human\": false\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"RW-002\",\n+      \"pass\": \"a4\",\n+      \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\n+      \"resolution_level\": \"ARCHITECTURE_DELTA; isolated local evidence observed; future Stage3/live NOT_RUN\",\n+      \"source_findings\": [\n+        \"PANEL-A4-F-002\"\n+      ],\n+      \"changes_made\": \"For form.created first inspect nested data.form object: if data.form.sessionID==active_session_id and data.form.id is a nonempty string, latch single-turn/Step2 barrier and IMMEDIATELY send POST /api/session/{id}/form/{formID}/cancel on retained control lane<=0.25s, then interrupt<=0.10s, BEFORE validating title/fields/metadata or emitting invalid_serve_event. EVD-073 source Form.Info requires id,sessionID,title,fields (only root metadata optional; field-level title/required optional). Missing root title is a schema discrepancy but safety cancel is authoritative: successful cancel+interrupt completes normal cancelled attempt with ServeHealth+0/UpstreamBreaker+0, no watchdog60s wait and no Step2. This does not relabel source title optional. Missing/invalid id or sessionID ->immediate fail-closed(no foreign cancel); cancel failure/control disconnect ->immediate fail-closed; parent finally killpg(child_pgid) completes<=1.2s, no watchdog wait. Valid foreign nested sessionID ignored with0foreigncontrol. form.cancelled.data.id/sessionID settles only same owned form; not model token or first-event.\",\n+      \"packet_locations\": [\n+        \"/threat_model/threats/1\",\n+        \"/decisions/0/details/event_contract/safety_order\",\n+        \"/decisions/0/details/single_turn_control\",\n+        \"/verification_surface/4/process_resource_oracle/form_cancel\"\n+      ],\n+      \"verification\": \"EVD-075..078 observed local probes plus JSON Pointer/schema/fingerprint checks; actual Stage3 VER-001..005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a5/r9 review pending.\",\n+      \"decision_required_human\": false\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"RW-003\",\n+      \"pass\": \"a4\",\n+      \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\n+      \"resolution_level\": \"ARCHITECTURE_DELTA; isolated local evidence observed; future Stage3/live NOT_RUN\",\n+      \"source_findings\": [\n+        \"PANEL-A4-F-003\",\n+        \"PANEL-A4-F-006\"\n+      ],\n+      \"changes_made\": \"EVD-075 now real4021-line source copy; early+pre-_run_env whitespace mutations, closed check1/write0/recheck0, old1:6 controlrc1; 3 literal hashes unchanged and 3 actual expanded-write negative hashes REJECT. No product writes.\",\n+      \"packet_locations\": [\n+        \"/evidence/69\",\n         \"/verification_surface/3/command\",\n         \"/verification_surface/3/expected\",\n+        \"/verification_surface/4/immutable_google_slices\"\n+      ],\n+      \"verification\": \"EVD-075..078 observed local probes plus JSON Pointer/schema/fingerprint checks; actual Stage3 VER-001..005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a5/r9 review pending.\",\n+      \"decision_required_human\": false\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"RW-004\",\n+      \"pass\": \"a4\",\n+      \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\n+      \"resolution_level\": \"ARCHITECTURE_DELTA; isolated local evidence observed; future Stage3/live NOT_RUN\",\n+      \"source_findings\": [\n+        \"PANEL-A4-F-005\"\n+      ],\n+      \"changes_made\": \"Static import zen_catalog as zc retained, public CATALOG_SOURCE=\\\"static\\\"+typed globals setter+proc None guards. EVD-076 errors0/serverwarnings564/reportAny125; EVD-077 full exact VER004 local blockrc0/counters/changed ranges/lint/write hashes/catalog8tests. No suppression/budget expansion.\",\n+      \"packet_locations\": [\n+        \"/evidence/70\",\n+        \"/evidence/71\",\n         \"/verification_surface/3/baseline_transition/new\",\n-        \"/verification_surface/4/immutable_google_slices\",\n         \"/decisions/0/details/typing\",\n-        \"/evidence/69\"\n-      ],\n-      \"verification\": \"EVD-075 observed isolated Ruff/hash proof; EVD-076 observed isolated type/catalog proof; JSON/schema/coverage invariants checked before handoff. VER-004 all3 and VER-005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a4 verdict pending.\",\n+        \"/risks/7/mitigation\",\n+        \"/verification_policy/strict_typing\"\n+      ],\n+      \"verification\": \"EVD-075..078 observed local probes plus JSON Pointer/schema/fingerprint checks; actual Stage3 VER-001..005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a5/r9 review pending.\",\n       \"decision_required_human\": false\n@@ -4624,19 +5030,14 @@\n     {\n-      \"id\": \